.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Verify that special characters in text are escaped
.#-----------------------------------------------------
text ~{~{info}}foo~{~{/info}} {x}
see ~[~[Page]] and a_b *c* ~~d~~ x^2^ ~![~[img.png]] wow!
~# not heading
10. not list
a <b>c</b> d &amp; e < f & g
~> not quote
~: not definition
+ not list
- not list
~=== not heading
~~~~~~ not code
back\slash \* ##a_b## {{code}}a_b{{/code}}
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
text \{{info}}foo\{{/info}} {x}  
see \[\[Page]] and a\_b \*c\* \~d\~ x\^2\^ !\[\[img.png]] wow!  
\# not heading  
10\. not list  
a \<b>c\</b> d \&amp; e < f & g  
\> not quote  
\: not definition  
\+ not list  
\- not list  
\=== not heading  
\~\~\~ not code  
back\\slash \\\* `a_b` `a_b`
